Prefer using the MPI module in module scope to avoid visiblity issues.

Also fix a couple Fortran language violations uncovered by this change.

diff -urN MUMPS_5.9.0/src/cana_aux_par.F.orig MUMPS_5.9.0/src/cana_aux_par.F
